[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    82[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The debug-cdylib rows matter independently of features: they enable Rust's
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    83[0m:[38;5;10m[49m arithmetic overflow checks. C wraps silently on signed overflow, so any place the
